# StepUp Cursor Rules

## Backend (FastAPI)

- Router → Service → Repository layer order is mandatory
- Raise errors using: `NotFoundError`, `ValidationError`, `PermissionError` (`app/errors/__init__.py`)
- Pull error messages from `app/errors/messages.py`
- Use `async def` + `await` for all async functions
- Inject DB session via `Depends(get_db)`

## Frontend (React + TypeScript)

- Import API types from `src/types/api.ts` (`components['schemas']['XxxResponse']`)
- Make API calls through `src/lib/apiClient.ts`
- API endpoint URLs come from `src/constants/apiEndpoints.ts`
- Route paths come from `src/constants/routes.ts`
- Never use the `any` type

## General

- Write tests (backend: pytest, frontend: vitest)
- No hardcoded strings – use constants files
- Do not refactor unrelated code
- Do not rename files without an explicit instruction
